-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ה/8 (4.5.2025): הגשת בקשה לתקצוב שעות פרופסיונליות בשנה"ל תשפ"ה בשל השינוי במבנה שבוע העבודה בחטיבות העליונות
-- The new work week of the agreement of 23.9.2024 shrank some Oz LaTmura
-- teachers' positions. The owning bodies keep each teacher's approved
-- position for תשפ"ה by adding frontal hours, and the Ministry budgets
-- "professional" hours to help: by a uniform normative key for a body that
-- signs a commitment letter by 25.5.2025, or on an individual request.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in days from the circular
-- (4.5.2025 = day 0): 25.5.2025 is day 21, 3.6.2025 day 30, 17.6.2025 day 44.

§ `תשפ"ה/8 תקצוב שעות פרופסיונליות`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date (4.5.2025), reference number, circular number, addressee (the owners of the upper divisions), greeting and subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `professional-hours action` IS ONE OF
    `update the position base and work-week structure from 1.11.2024` HAS `teachers updated` IS A NUMBER
    `add frontal teaching hours` HAS `frontal hours added` IS A NUMBER
    `grant unpaid leave for the reduced share` HAS `share on unpaid leave` IS A NUMBER
    `sign the commitment letter online` HAS `upper divisions covered` IS A NUMBER
    `submit an individual request` HAS `hours requested` IS A NUMBER
    `offset the professional hours paid` HAS `hours offset` IS A NUMBER
    `transfer the payslips` HAS `payslips transferred` IS A NUMBER
    `cooperate with the Ministry's inspector`

@desc An Oz LaTmura teacher's position in תשפ"ה before and after the change of the work week.
DECLARE `teacher in תשפ"ה` HAS
    `position before the change`        IS A NUMBER  @desc the position set for the teacher for תשפ"ה before the change (1 = 100%)
    `position after the change`         IS A NUMBER  @desc the position the same hours make under the new work-week tables
    `is a permanent teaching employee`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `chose not to add hours`            IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `mother band` HAS
    `from age`  IS A NUMBER
    `below age` IS A NUMBER  @desc the first age past the band; "50-55" is read as including 55, so its bound is 56
    `hours`     IS A NUMBER

@desc A teacher the school asks professional hours for, as ג.1 checks it.
DECLARE `requested teacher` HAS
    `hours requested for the teacher`                  IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours reported by 14.11.2024`             IS A NUMBER
    `frontal hours reported after the update`          IS A NUMBER
    `in Oz LaTmura`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `is the principal`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `reported for תשפ"ה by 14.11.2024`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches the added hours in class`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `position with the employer`                        IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `cap band` HAS
    `from position` IS A NUMBER
    `to position`   IS A NUMBER
    `cap`           IS A NUMBER


§§ `Purpose`

-- p13: following the circular of 13.11.2024, the Ministry budgets extra
-- professional weekly hours for תשפ"ה only, to the owning bodies of upper
-- divisions it supervises and budgets that are eligible for tuition
-- budgeting, to help with the cost of keeping the positions approved for
-- Oz LaTmura teachers in תשפ"ה.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
GIVEN `owns an upper division the Ministry supervises and budgets` IS A BOOLEAN, `eligible for tuition budgeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be budgeted professional hours` `owns an upper division the Ministry supervises and budgets` `eligible for tuition budgeting` IF
    `owns an upper division the Ministry supervises and budgets` AND `eligible for tuition budgeting`

§§ `א הבהרות ועדכונים לעניין עדכון היקף המשרה`

-- akn:art_a/p1 The heading of part א, "clarifications and updates on updating the position of Oz LaTmura teachers to the new work week in תשפ"ה".

-- א.א: by the wages commissioner's instruction, the position base and the
-- work-week structure of teachers (not principals) are updated in their
-- pay from 1.11.2024 by the work-week tables of the agreement of
-- 23.9.2024; the OSHER reporting system need not be updated again.
@ref akn:art_a__para_a
GIVEN `teachers who are not principals` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `update the teachers' work week in their pay` `teachers who are not principals` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `update the position base and work-week structure from 1.11.2024` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `teachers who are not principals`


-- ב and ג: a teacher whose position shrank against the one set for תשפ"ה
-- before the change is given added frontal teaching hours to keep it,
-- under the rules of ד — also one employed below a third of a position.
-- Fractions of an hour (a half, a quarter) may be added. The hours a
-- position needs are the work-week tables' and an input.
@ref akn:art_b akn:art_b/p2 akn:art_c
GIVEN t IS A `teacher in תשפ"ה`, `frontal hours that restore the position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `keep the teacher's position` t `frontal hours that restore the position` IS
    IF `the position shrank` t AND NOT t's `chose not to add hours`
    THEN PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `add frontal teaching hours` h
               PROVIDED h AT LEAST `frontal hours that restore the position`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/8 ב: frontal hours are added to keep the position set for תשפ\"ה"
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN t IS A `teacher in תשפ"ה`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position shrank` t IF
    t's `position after the change` LESS THAN t's `position before the change`


-- ד.1: the added hour is real teaching in class, set in the teacher's and
-- the pupils' timetable (half an hour may be one hour every two weeks); the
-- individual or stay hours it draws under the work-week table are also
-- done in the school.
@ref akn:art_d__para_1 akn:art_d__para_1/p2
GIVEN `taught in class and in the timetable` IS A BOOLEAN, `the hours it draws are done in the school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an added hour meets the rules` `taught in class and in the timetable` `the hours it draws are done in the school` IF
    `taught in class and in the timetable` AND `the hours it draws are done in the school`

-- ד.2: under 8(ה) of the agreement of 23.9.2024, for an employee above
-- 100%, changes of position caused by the move to the new work week are no
-- ground for a claim of harm to the position commitment; the position
-- compared is the one with the same owning body.
@ref akn:art_d__para_2 akn:art_d__para_2/p2 akn:art_d__para_2/p3
GIVEN `position with this owning body before the change` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a change of position from the new work week founds no claim of harm` `position with this owning body before the change` IF
    `position with this owning body before the change` GREATER THAN 1

-- ה: a teacher may choose not to add hours despite the lower position; a
-- permanent teacher who so chooses is allowed unpaid leave for תשפ"ה on
-- the share that fell.
@ref akn:art_e akn:art_e/p2
GIVEN t IS A `teacher in תשפ"ה`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `allow unpaid leave on the reduced share` t IS
    IF `the position shrank` t AND t's `chose not to add hours` AND t's `is a permanent teaching employee`
    THEN PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
         MUST  `grant unpaid leave for the reduced share` s
               PROVIDED s AT LEAST t's `position before the change` MINUS t's `position after the change`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ה/8 ה: a permanent teacher who does not add hours is allowed unpaid leave on the share that fell"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ו: the frontal hours that earn the mother's supplement in Oz LaTmura are
-- unchanged: 19 under 50, 18 at 50-55, 16 at 55 and over. Age 55 is in
-- both of the last two bands (F-2024-25_tashpah_08-a); the band that opens
-- at 55 is read as governing it.
@ref akn:art_f
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `frontal hours that earn the mother's supplement` age IS
    BRANCH IF age AT LEAST 55 THEN 16
           IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 18
           OTHERWISE 19

-- The bands as printed, to show where they overlap.
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours the bands give for age` age IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `hours`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD age AT LEAST b's `from age` AND age LESS THAN b's `below age`)
                `the mother's-supplement bands as printed`)
    WHERE
        `the mother's-supplement bands as printed` MEANS
            LIST `mother band` 0  50  19,
                 `mother band` 50 56  18,
                 `mother band` 55 999 16

§§ `ב תקצוב נורמטיבי לשעות פרופסיונליות`

-- akn:art_f__para_b/p1 The heading of part ב, "normative budgeting of professional hours".

-- ב, first paragraph: the budget is given by a uniform normative key, with
-- no individual request and no payslips; the owning body signs online a
-- commitment to keep its teachers' positions for תשפ"ה by the agreement's
-- work week and to make no further demands of the Ministry on this.
@ref akn:art_f__para_b/p2
GIVEN `signed the commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is budgeted by the normative key` `signed the commitment` IF
    `signed the commitment`

-- akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1/p1 The heading "1. the normative key for professional hours".

@desc The owning body's weekly-hour totals in the Ministry's payments system (MATAM) that the normative key reads.
DECLARE `body's weekly hours` HAS
    `tuition hours (topic 1)`                            IS A NUMBER
    `share of positions in Oz LaTmura`                   IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of the body's positions that are in Oz LaTmura
    `role hours (topic 559, drag 1)`                      IS A NUMBER
    `held-institution hours (topics 446-448)`            IS A NUMBER
    `role hours for held institutions (topic 575, drag 3)` IS A NUMBER
    `Oz frontal hours in salary merging (topic 40, drag 3)` IS A NUMBER
    `principal frontal hours (topic 558, drag 1)`        IS A NUMBER
    `age hours`                                          IS A NUMBER  @desc "שעות גיל" in 1.ב's denominator; the circular does not define it for a body (F-2024-25_tashpah_08-b)

-- 1.א: the frontal hours budgeted are 1.75% of the total of the four
-- topics (the tuition and held-institution hours multiplied by the share
-- of positions in Oz LaTmura), less the two topics listed as minus.
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p2 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p3 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p4 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p5 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p6 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p7 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a/p8
GIVEN w IS A `body's weekly hours`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours of the key` w IS
    1.75% TIMES (`the topics' total` MINUS `the topics in minus`)
    WHERE
        `the topics' total` MEANS
            sum (LIST w's `tuition hours (topic 1)` TIMES w's `share of positions in Oz LaTmura`,
                      w's `role hours (topic 559, drag 1)`,
                      w's `held-institution hours (topics 446-448)` TIMES w's `share of positions in Oz LaTmura`,
                      w's `role hours for held institutions (topic 575, drag 3)`)
        `the topics in minus` MEANS
            w's `Oz frontal hours in salary merging (topic 40, drag 3)` PLUS w's `principal frontal hours (topic 558, drag 1)`

-- 1.ב: with them, individual hours of 3 × frontal / (25 − age hours) and
-- teaching-support hours of 10 × frontal / (25 − age hours), as the page
-- sets them as fractions (the corpus text prints them on one line).
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b/p2 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b/p3 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b/p4
GIVEN w IS A `body's weekly hours`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the individual hours of the key` w IS
    3 TIMES `the frontal hours of the key` w DIVIDED BY (25 MINUS w's `age hours`)

GIVEN w IS A `body's weekly hours`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the support hours of the key` w IS
    10 TIMES `the frontal hours of the key` w DIVIDED BY (25 MINUS w's `age hours`)

-- 1.ג: the hours are budgeted for the months 11/2024 to 8/2025.
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_1__cls_c
GIVEN `school month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the hours are budgeted for school month` `school month` IF
    `school month` AT LEAST 3 AND `school month` AT MOST 12

-- akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2/p1 The heading "2. further conditions of the normative budgeting".

-- 2.1: the body may move the hours received between its upper divisions
-- the Ministry supervises.
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_1
GIVEN `the receiving school is the body's supervised upper division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the hours may be moved to` `the receiving school is the body's supervised upper division` IF
    `the receiving school is the body's supervised upper division`

-- 2.2-2.3: the body must sign the commitment letter of annex א online in
-- the portal, covering every upper division it owns (not some of them);
-- one that has not signed by 25.5.2025 (day 21) is not entitled, and the
-- professional hours paid it so far are offset.
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_2 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_3
GIVEN `upper divisions the body owns` IS A NUMBER, `professional hours paid so far` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `sign the commitment for every upper division` `upper divisions the body owns` `professional hours paid so far` IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    DO    `sign the commitment letter online` n
          PROVIDED n EQUALS `upper divisions the body owns`
    WITHIN 21
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
          MUST  `offset the professional hours paid` h
                PROVIDED h EQUALS `professional hours paid so far`

-- 2.4: a body that does not sign and asks for budgeting on an individual
-- check submits a request per upper division, by its principal, online,
-- under the rules of ג, between 3.6.2025 and 17.6.2025 (days 30-44).
@ref akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_4 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_4/p2 akn:art_f__para_b__subpara_2__cls_4/p3
GIVEN `signed the commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `an individual request` `signed the commitment` IS
    IF `signed the commitment`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the school principal`
         MAY   `submit an individual request` h
               PROVIDED h AT LEAST 0
         WITHIN 44

GIVEN `day of submission` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is submitted in the window` `day of submission` IF
    `day of submission` AT LEAST 30 AND `day of submission` AT MOST 44

§§ `ג תקצוב חלופי עפ"י בקשה פרטנית`

-- akn:art_f__para_c/p1 The heading of part ג, "alternative budgeting of professional hours on an individual request".

-- ג, first paragraph: this route is open only to upper divisions that chose
-- not to take the normative key and did not sign annex א.
@ref akn:art_f__para_c/p2
GIVEN `signed the commitment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may use the individual route` `signed the commitment` IF
    NOT `signed the commitment`

-- akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1/p1 The heading "1. the conditions for budgeting on an individual request".

-- 1, opening: whatever the budget, the owning body is bound to every
-- teacher's position by the rules and agreements; what follows are rules
-- of budgeting only.
@ref akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1/p3
GIVEN t IS A `teacher in תשפ"ה`, `frontal hours that restore the position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `the position is owed whatever the budget` t `frontal hours that restore the position` IS
    `keep the teacher's position` t `frontal hours that restore the position`

-- ג.1 א-ו and ז: the budget follows a check of each teacher's data,
-- subject to: every budgeted hour of the institution executed and reported;
-- the teacher's reported frontal hours grew by at most one; an Oz LaTmura
-- teacher; not the principal; reported by 14.11.2024; actually teaching the
-- added hours; and employed by the employer between a third of a position
-- and 100%.
@ref akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_c akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_d akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_e akn:art_f__para_c__subpara_1__cls_f akn:art_g
GIVEN t IS A `requested teacher`, `all budgeted hours executed and reported` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher may be budgeted` t `all budgeted hours executed and reported` IF
        `all budgeted hours executed and reported`
    AND t's `frontal hours reported after the update` MINUS t's `frontal hours reported by 14.11.2024` AT MOST 1
    AND t's `in Oz LaTmura`
    AND NOT t's `is the principal`
    AND t's `reported for תשפ"ה by 14.11.2024`
    AND t's `teaches the added hours in class`
    AND t's `position with the employer` AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    AND t's `position with the employer` AT MOST 1

-- ח as printed: 33% to 75% at most 0.5 hour; 75% to 100% (inclusive) at
-- most one. 75% is in both bands (F-2024-25_tashpah_08-c); the reading
-- adopted: the band that opens at 75% governs it. Above 100% or below a
-- third, ז gives no budget.
@ref akn:art_h
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap on the hours for position` p IS
    BRANCH IF p GREATER THAN 1 THEN 0
           IF p AT LEAST 0.75 THEN 1
           IF p AT LEAST 1 DIVIDED BY 3 THEN 0.5
           OTHERWISE 0

-- The bands as printed, to show where they overlap.
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the caps the bands of ח give for position` p IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `cap`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD p AT LEAST b's `from position` AND p AT MOST b's `to position`)
                (LIST `cap band` 0.33 0.75 0.5,
                      `cap band` 0.75 1    1))

GIVEN t IS A `requested teacher`, `all budgeted hours executed and reported` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours budgeted for the teacher` t `all budgeted hours executed and reported` IS
    IF `the teacher may be budgeted` t `all budgeted hours executed and reported`
    THEN min (t's `hours requested for the teacher`) (`the cap on the hours for position` (t's `position with the employer`))
    ELSE 0

-- ט, יא, יב: hours paid beyond what the check finds are offset; where the
-- reported data do not match the actual pay and employment, or the hours
-- were not used (wholly or in part) for their purpose, all the
-- professional hours of תשפ"ה are offset, and the Ministry will consider
-- barring GEFEN conversions in תשפ"ו (a discretion, not a rule).
@ref akn:art_i akn:art_jb akn:art_ja
GIVEN `hours paid` IS A NUMBER, `hours found due` IS A NUMBER, `data mismatch or hours misused` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours to offset` `hours paid` `hours found due` `data mismatch or hours misused` IS
    IF `data mismatch or hours misused`
    THEN `hours paid`
    ELSE max 0 (`hours paid` MINUS `hours found due`)

GIVEN `hours paid` IS A NUMBER, `hours found due` IS A NUMBER, `data mismatch or hours misused` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `the Ministry offsets` `hours paid` `hours found due` `data mismatch or hours misused` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `offset the professional hours paid` h
          PROVIDED h EQUALS `hours to offset` `hours paid` `hours found due` `data mismatch or hours misused`

-- י: the principal and the owning body transfer the payslips of the
-- teachers budgeting is asked for, and of others when the Ministry asks.
@ref akn:art_j
GIVEN `teachers asked for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `transfer the payslips of the teachers asked for` `teachers asked for` IS
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `transfer the payslips` n
           PROVIDED n AT LEAST `teachers asked for`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `transfer the payslips` n
           PROVIDED n AT LEAST `teachers asked for`)

-- יא: the principal and the body cooperate with the Ministry's
-- representative or auditing accountant in checking the request, the hours
-- and the staff report, timetables included.
@ref akn:art_ja
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `cooperate with the check` IS
    (PARTY `the school principal`
     MUST  `cooperate with the Ministry's inspector`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
     MUST  `cooperate with the Ministry's inspector`)

§§ `2 אופן הגשת הבקשה`

-- akn:art_jb__para_2/p1 The heading "2. how the request for professional hours on an individual request is submitted".

-- 2.א-ב: the principal submits online through the portal; the screen lists
-- every teacher reported in the upper division by 14.11.2024, with whether
-- that report was correct or in error that day.
@ref akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_a akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN `reported in the upper division by 14.11.2024` IS A BOOLEAN, `merges salaries with the State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher is on the request screen` `reported in the upper division by 14.11.2024` `merges salaries with the State` IF
    `reported in the upper division by 14.11.2024` AND NOT `merges salaries with the State`

-- 2.ג: teachers who merge salaries with the State are not shown; they are
-- checked separately and not in the school's request.
@ref akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN `merges salaries with the State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is checked outside the school's request` `merges salaries with the State` IF
    `merges salaries with the State`

-- 2.ד: for each teacher the principal enters the hours asked, between 0
-- and 1 inclusive, and whether the teacher agreed to teach them and to do
-- the individual and stay hours derived from them.
@ref akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_d akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_d/p2 akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_d/p3
GIVEN `hours entered` IS A NUMBER, `the teacher agreed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teacher's line is complete` `hours entered` `the teacher agreed` IF
    `hours entered` AT LEAST 0 AND `hours entered` AT MOST 1 AND `the teacher agreed`

-- 2.ה-ו: the principal certifies that the actual positions are as reported
-- and updated in OSHER, and attaches the body's commitment to keep the
-- teachers' positions for תשפ"ה under the agreement's work week.
@ref akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_e akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_f akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_g
GIVEN `principal certified the positions` IS A BOOLEAN, `body's commitment attached` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `payslips of September 2024 to January 2025 attached` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the request is complete` `principal certified the positions` `body's commitment attached` `payslips of September 2024 to January 2025 attached` IF
        `principal certified the positions`
    AND `body's commitment attached`
    AND `payslips of September 2024 to January 2025 attached`

-- 2.ז-ח: the payslips of September 2024-January 2025 are attached; those of
-- February-August 2025 for teachers approved are sent by dates the Ministry
-- will set (an input).
@ref akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_g akn:art_jb__para_2__subpara_h
GIVEN `teachers approved` IS A NUMBER, `days to the date the Ministry sets` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `professional-hours action`
DECIDE `send the later payslips` `teachers approved` `days to the date the Ministry sets` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `transfer the payslips` n
          PROVIDED n AT LEAST `teachers approved`
    WITHIN `days to the date the Ministry sets`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off, signatures and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples. The hour totals are placeholders.
`a body's hours` MEANS
    `body's weekly hours` WITH
        `tuition hours (topic 1)`                              IS 2000
        `share of positions in Oz LaTmura`                     IS 0.9
        `role hours (topic 559, drag 1)`                        IS 100
        `held-institution hours (topics 446-448)`              IS 200
        `role hours for held institutions (topic 575, drag 3)` IS 20
        `Oz frontal hours in salary merging (topic 40, drag 3)` IS 50
        `principal frontal hours (topic 558, drag 1)`          IS 10
        `age hours`                                            IS 0

-- (1800 + 100 + 180 + 20 − 60) × 1.75% = 35.7; 3/25 and 10/25 of it.
#ASSERT `the frontal hours of the key` `a body's hours` EQUALS 35.7
#ASSERT `the individual hours of the key` `a body's hours` EQUALS 4.284
#ASSERT `the support hours of the key` `a body's hours` EQUALS 14.28

#ASSERT `frontal hours that earn the mother's supplement` 49 EQUALS 19
#ASSERT `frontal hours that earn the mother's supplement` 52 EQUALS 18
#ASSERT `frontal hours that earn the mother's supplement` 60 EQUALS 16
#ASSERT `the cap on the hours for position` 0.5 EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `the cap on the hours for position` 1.1 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `hours to offset` 10 6 FALSE EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `hours to offset` 10 6 TRUE EQUALS 10

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_08-a: age 55 is in the bands "50-55" and "55 ומעלה".
`ו gives a 55-year-old two hour counts` MEANS
    `the frontal hours the bands give for age` 55 EQUALS LIST 18, 16
#ASSERT `ו gives a 55-year-old two hour counts`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_08-c: a position of exactly 75% is in both bands of ח.
`ח gives a 75% position two caps` MEANS
    `the caps the bands of ח give for position` 0.75 EQUALS LIST 0.5, 1
#ASSERT `ח gives a 75% position two caps`

-- F-2024-25_tashpah_08-b: the key divides by (25 − age hours), a quantity
-- that belongs to a single teacher; for one body the result moves with
-- whichever teacher's age hours are taken.
`the same body's hours with four age hours` MEANS
    `body's weekly hours` WITH
        `tuition hours (topic 1)`                              IS 2000
        `share of positions in Oz LaTmura`                     IS 0.9
        `role hours (topic 559, drag 1)`                        IS 100
        `held-institution hours (topics 446-448)`              IS 200
        `role hours for held institutions (topic 575, drag 3)` IS 20
        `Oz frontal hours in salary merging (topic 40, drag 3)` IS 50
        `principal frontal hours (topic 558, drag 1)`          IS 10
        `age hours`                                            IS 4

`the key's individual hours turn on the undefined age hours` MEANS
    NOT (`the individual hours of the key` `a body's hours`
         EQUALS `the individual hours of the key` `the same body's hours with four age hours`)
#ASSERT `the key's individual hours turn on the undefined age hours`

#TRACE `sign the commitment for every upper division` 3 120 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `sign the commitment letter online` 3 AT 15
#TRACE `sign the commitment for every upper division` 3 120 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `sign the commitment letter online` 2 AT 15
